<main class="terms-container" id="mainContent">

  <h1>Contact Us</h1>

  <p class="last-updated">Last updated: November 6, 2026</p>

  <p class="intro-text">
    We'd love to hear from you. Whether you have a question, found a bug, want to suggest a new feature, or just want to say hello — drop us a line and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.
  </p>

  <div class="contact-card">
    <h2>Email Us</h2>
    <p>The fastest way to reach us is by email. We read every message personally.</p>
    <p class="contact-email"><a href="mailto:contact@wheeloffun.app">contact@wheeloffun.app</a></p>
    <p class="contact-response">Typical response time: within 48 hours.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What Can We Help With?</h2>
  <p>Here are some of the things people usually write to us about:</p>

  <ul class="contact-topics">
    <li>
      <svg class="topic-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
