      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg class="topic-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg>
      <div class="topic-text">
        <strong>Feature ideas</strong>
        <span>Have an idea for a new tool, theme, or setting? We're always listening.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg class="topic-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
      <div class="topic-text">
