      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg class="topic-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z"/><path d="M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6"/></svg>
      <div class="topic-text">
        <strong>Partnerships &amp; press</strong>
        <span>Business inquiries, collaborations, or media requests.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Before You Write</h2>
  <p>To help us respond faster, please include the following in your email where relevant:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>A clear subject line</strong> — for example, "Bug: wheel not spinning on Safari" or "Feature request: custom sounds".</li>
    <li><strong>Your browser and device</strong> — e.g. Chrome 120 on Windows 11, or Safari on iPhone 15.</li>
    <li><strong>Steps to reproduce</strong> — if reporting a bug, describe what you did and what happened.</li>
    <li><strong>A screenshot or screen recording</strong> — if it helps explain the issue.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This is not required, but it makes a big difference in how quickly we can help.</p>

  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <div class="faq-inline">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">How quickly will I get a response?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Most messages are answered within 48 hours. Bug reports and security issues are prioritized and usually get a reply the same day. If it's been more than 3 business days and you haven't heard back, feel free to send a quick follow-up — occasionally emails land in spam.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">Is Wheel Of Fun really free? Are there hidden costs?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Yes — completely free. There's no account, no subscription, no paywall, and no premium tier. The site is supported by advertising and occasional affiliate links, so you never have to pay to use the wheel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">Do you save or store the entries I type into the wheel?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">No. Every entry, image, spin, and result stays inside your browser and is never sent to any server. Saved wheels are stored locally in your browser's <code>localStorage</code>. If you clear your browser's site data, everything disappears — which is exactly how it should be.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">How do I report a bug or suggest a new feature?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@wheeloffun.app">contact@wheeloffun.app</a> with a clear subject line (e.g. "Bug: wheel not spinning on Safari" or "Feature request: custom sounds"). For bug reports, include your browser, device, and steps to reproduce. Screenshots or a short screen recording help a lot.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">Can I use Wheel Of Fun for commercial purposes or paid events?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Yes. You're welcome to use the wheel for giveaways, raffles, live streams, team meetings, classroom activities, or any commercial setting. Just don't resell the tool itself, rebrand it as your own, or scrape the code — see our <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for full details.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">How do I exercise my GDPR or CCPA privacy rights?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Email <a href="mailto:contact@wheeloffun.app">contact@wheeloffun.app</a> with the subject line "Privacy request" and describe what you'd like — access, correction, deletion, portability, or an opt-out. Because the wheel never stores your entries on a server, there's usually nothing to delete for that data. For cookie or analytics data, we'll guide you through the correct opt-out or deletion steps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">I found a security vulnerability. Where do I report it?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Please email <a href="mailto:contact@wheeloffun.app">contact@wheeloffun.app</a> with the subject line "Security" and include as much detail as you can — what you found, how to reproduce it, and its potential impact. We take all reports seriously and will respond quickly. Please don't publicly disclose the issue until we've had a chance to fix it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">Do you offer phone support or a live chat?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">No — we're a small, email-only team. This keeps the site free and lets us focus on making the wheel better. Email is the fastest way to reach us, and every message gets read.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">Can I request a custom wheel design or custom development?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">For custom wheels, you can build anything yourself in the tool — add names, colours, images, and settings. For larger custom development work, email us with a short description of what you have in mind and we'll let you know if we can help or point you in the right direction.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <p class="faq-q">Is my email address safe if I contact you?</p>
      <p class="faq-a">Yes. We only use your email address to reply to your message. We don't sell it, share it with advertisers, or add you to any mailing list. See our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for full details.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-block">
    <p>Still have a question? <a href="mailto:contact@wheeloffun.app">Email us</a> — we're happy to help.</p>
  </div>

